/**
 * A town in a few numbers (docs/townregister.html): what its card's head and Overview read, and what the
 * register will rank. Made the same way from any town in memory, so a town never shows two different
 * counts for one thing. No DOM and no THREE here, so the survey worker can make digests too.
 */

